  <section class="content">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>
      I'm a QA Engineer transitioning from customer service and digital content roles into tech.
      Working in high-volume, bilingual customer support at DoorDash taught me how to analyze
      complex issues, identify patterns, and collaborate across teams — skills that quickly
      translated into my QA work.
    </p>
    <p>
      During my training at TripleTen and through hands-on projects, I developed strong abilities
      in manual testing, API validation, bug reporting, and functional QA documentation. I enjoy
      breaking systems in the right way and ensuring users get the smoothest possible experience.
    </p>
